      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A few things have happened:\n\n- There was a scheduled [database maintenance](https://status.vrchat.com/incidents/t8q9m5693d8b) on July 14, 2026.\n\n- There was also a \"[special maintenance](https://status.vrchat.com/incidents/y8rrxmtz20pf)\" on July 15, 2026.\n\n- An exemption list has been created.\n\nThere's no ETA when or if the feature will return, but an exemption list has been added to this feature to support its potential return in the future. It seems they're still working on it.",
